      "text": "More illegal aliens stopped by @CBPAMO!\n\n23 arrested in failed human smuggling attempt off the California Coast! On Saturday, DHC-8 and Multi-Role Enforcement Aircraft aircrews coordinated with a Coastal Interceptor Vessel Crew to intercept a panga-style vessel west of San Clemente Island.\n\nAfter maintaining visual contact and vectoring support from the air, Marine Interdiction Agents successfully interdicted the vessel with 23 illegal aliens onboard just after 1:00 p.m. Air and Marine Operations seized the vessel, and all subjects were turned over to San Diego ICE ERO. Excellent teamwork and coordination from the air and sea ensured a safe and effective operation! #BorderSecurity",
